== Frequently Asked Questions ==

**What kind of file does the Easy Export plugin export?**

The Easy Export plugin will output the data into a CSV & PDF and also print out spreadsheets.

**How many Lists are there?**

There are 9 Lists and those lists are: Order List, Order Summary, Yearly Summary, Total Sales Amount, Billing List, Shipping List, Mailing List, Product List and the
Category List

**What happened if I deactivate the plugin or delete the plugin?**

If you deactivate the plugin it will stay on the plugin page and if you delete/remove the plugin it will delete the folders, files.
